@startuml decisions
title LLD 3 · Decisions: Run.decide (nayose apply decisions ~--workspace …), scoring nothing
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6F8
  BorderColor #65717E
}
skinparam file {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E6
  BorderColor #B07D00
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #65717E
}

actor "people" as people
file "reviewed.parquet: review.parquet with decision filled in, or any file with <id>_l, <id>_r, decision" as f_decided
file "gold.parquet (the run's)" as f_gold_in

rectangle "<b>decide</b> · O(D + touched clusters) + O(N)\nRun.decide · folder.finish_writes · folder.latest_decisions · folder.parts · source.decisions · source.file_facts · io.replace_text\nthe checks, every ID a record of the run: source.known · each match pair merges its two clusters: cluster.merge, each cluster one node\nkinds kept, a merged customer's kind again: run.customer_kinds\nthe round it is decided in: folder.rounds\nfolder.next_part · folder.stage · Run._log · folder.log · io.code_version" as decide

note right of decide
  stops, with what to fix (exit 2):
  the columns missing; a decision not match or no_match;
  a pair decided both ways; an ID not in the run.
  A no_match pair splits nothing now: a full run
  on this folder never accepts it again.
end note

file "gold.parquet: rewritten; a record joined only this way is resolved by review" as f_gold_out
file "decisions/part-n.parquet: kept for good; a full run applies them again" as f_kept
file "steps.json: a decisions entry" as f_steps

people --> f_decided
f_decided --> decide
f_gold_in --> decide
decide --> f_gold_out
decide --> f_kept
decide --> f_steps
@enduml
